{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-238",
  "title": "Pitch Draft 1",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "reviewing",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Pitch Draft 1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**1. Problem**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Modern knowledge work is fragmented. People spend hours copy-pasting context between tools—notes, emails, docs, calendars—just to keep mental continuity. AI assistants forget everything between sessions, forcing users to repeat themselves."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This “copy-paste economy” kills flow, wastes time, and turns intelligent people into manual integrators of their own work. The pain is highest for:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Executives juggling multi-modal inputs"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-6",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Creatives with sprawling digital assets"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Power users orchestrating complex projects across tools"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Example: A founder prepping for a pitch needs to search across docs, emails, notes, and tasks—then re-explain context to every AI tool they touch. None of it is remembered, connected, or actionable."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**2. Solution**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Nodebook** is an agent-native productivity platform disguised as a workspace tool."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "It unifies your digital life into a programmable knowledge graph—emails, tasks, notes, projects, people, and more—and wraps it in a ChatGPT-style interface that knows *you*."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-14",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Everything is a node (files, people, goals, ideas)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-15",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Meaning emerges from relationships"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-16",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Agents operate directly on your graph with permissioned access"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Unlike other tools, Nodebook is **not** just an app—it’s a thinking environment. You don’t just store information; you orchestrate insight."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*Demo*: [Insert UI or short video—show the agent navigating the graph, suggesting connections, organizing across services]"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**3. Market**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Initial Beachhead**: Knowledge-dense solo operators (founders, researchers, execs) who already use tools like Notion, Obsidian, ChatGPT, and email automations."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**TAM/SAM/SOM**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-24",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "5M+ prosumers using personal productivity + AI tools (SAM)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-25",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Initial SOM: 100K early adopters in AI + productivity communities"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Future scale includes teams, vertical SaaS integrations, and APIs for agent developers."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4**. Product / Traction**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-30",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Prototype functional with live sync to Gmail, GCal, Notion, Slack, and local files"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-31",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Early access list: 2,300+ users (growing 30% monthly)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-32",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Alpha testers using it to auto-organize weekly planning, generate reports, and query personal history"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Surprise: Users treat Nodebook like a **command line for cognition**—asking agents to refactor goals, summarize cross-platform activity, or even self-reflect."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**5. Team**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-37",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Founder**: Deep background in systems design, productivity tools, and cognitive computing"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-38",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Built previous agentic interfaces; contributed to open-source knowledge graph tooling"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-39",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Advisors from AI, UX, and systems philosophy domains"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "We didn’t stumble on this—we’ve been chasing it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-42",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**6. Business Model**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-44",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "SaaS: $15–30/month per user (pro + power plans)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-45",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Expansion into team licenses, agent marketplaces, and enterprise API integrations"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-46",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Optional cloud sync features with premium storage + compute pricing"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Data and agents get more valuable over time, not less—creating compound retention."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**7. Go-to-Market**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-54",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-51",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Community-first motion via Twitter, Substack, and product demos"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-52",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Early adopters from AI, productivity, and PKM communities"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-53",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Onboarding includes GPT-powered setup wizard that learns your workflows"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-55",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Warm intros and user invites have a 22% conversion rate to active use."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-56",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-57",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**8. Competition**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-58",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Competitors**: Notion, Obsidian, Superhuman, ChatGPT (with plugins), Apple Intelligence (coming soon)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-59",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Differentiation**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-64",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-60",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Full-context agentic execution (not just chat with memory)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-61",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Local-first sync engine + programmable graph"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-62",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Real-time graph UI (not markdown or tabular views)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-63",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "UX is the wedge; **infrastructure is the moat**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-65",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Most “AI tools” are front-ends for rented intelligence. Nodebook makes your context *computable*."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-66",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-67",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**9. Vision**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-68",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "In 5 years, Nodebook is the **thinking layer of agentic computing**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-69",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "It evolves from a productivity app into a universal substrate for AI agents, thought augmentation, and context-aware automation."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-70",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Where others bolt on AI, Nodebook is *built* for it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-71",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-72",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**10. Ask**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-73",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Raising**: $1.5M pre-seed"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-77",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-74",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Funds 12–15 months of runway for a 4-person core team"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-75",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Milestones: full public beta, 5K MAUs, agent SDK + marketplace live"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-76",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "$600K soft-committed from aligned angels (UX, infra, AI)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}